1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,430
Un flamant rose n'est

2
00:00:01,430 --> 00:00:02,430
pas né rose.

3
00:00:02,430 --> 00:00:03,230
Il naît en duvet

4
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:04,350
gris clair.

5
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:04,670
Alors,

6
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:05,490
d'où vient ce rose

7
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:06,230
?

8
00:00:06,230 --> 00:00:06,790
Il vient de son

9
00:00:06,790 --> 00:00:07,590
assiette.

10
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:08,510
Le flamant plonge la

11
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:09,310
tête à l'envers dans

12
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:10,630
l'eau et filtre ce

13
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:11,730
qu'il y trouve :

14
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:13,030
des algues microscopiques

15
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:14,830
et de minuscules crevettes.

16
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:16,010
Ces algues contiennent des

17
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:16,890
pigments,

18
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:18,450
des matières colorées :

19
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:19,490
les caroténoïdes.

20
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:20,210
Ce sont les mêmes

21
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:21,030
qui rendent les carottes

22
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:21,950
orange.

23
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:22,750
La couleur passe de

24
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:24,170
l'algue à la crevette,

25
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:25,250
puis au flamant.

26
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:26,450
Il les digère,

27
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:27,330
son corps les envoie

28
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:27,950
dans ses plumes,

29
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:28,770
et petit à petit,

30
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:29,970
il rosit.

31
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:30,870
Il lui faut plusieurs

32
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:31,870
années.

33
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:32,530
Mais un poussin ne

34
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:33,470
mange pas d'algues.

35
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:34,450
Pas encore.

36
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:35,550
Comment fait-il pour rosir

37
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:36,470
?

38
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:37,150
Ses parents lui donnent

39
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:38,670
leur propre couleur.

40
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:39,650
Dans leur gorge,

41
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:40,530
ils fabriquent un lait,

42
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:41,010
rouge vif,

43
00:00:41,010 --> 00:00:42,590
chargé des mêmes pigments.

44
00:00:42,590 --> 00:00:43,610
Repas après repas,

45
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:44,320
le rose quitte leurs

46
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:45,250
plumes et passe dans

47
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:46,250
le poussin.

48
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:46,790
À la fin de

49
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:47,330
la saison,

50
00:00:47,330 --> 00:00:48,050
les parents sont presque

51
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:48,690
blancs,

52
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:49,290
et lui,

53
00:00:49,290 --> 00:00:49,790
de plus en plus

54
00:00:49,790 --> 00:00:50,650
rose.

55
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:51,510
La prochaine fois que

56
00:00:51,510 --> 00:00:52,270
tu croises un flamant

57
00:00:52,270 --> 00:00:53,010
tout pâle,

58
00:00:53,010 --> 00:00:53,710
ne le plains pas

59
00:00:53,710 --> 00:00:54,070
trop vite :

60
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:55,390
il a peut-être donné

61
00:00:55,390 --> 00:00:56,050
sa couleur à son

62
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:56,750
petit.

